  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2018/02/XerradaPoparIcriarColics.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p>(7 fotos) El sal&oacute;n de actos de la Casa de Cultura de Onda ha acogido esta semana la charla No m&aacute;s c&oacute;licos ni asimetr&iacute;as craneales. Prevenci&oacute;n y tratamiento, impartida por Neus Bort Saborit, fisioterapeuta y oste&oacute;pata infantil, y organizada por Popar i Criar.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/xarradalactantscolic/img_9631.jpg\" alt=\"img_9631\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/xarradalactantscolic/img_9635.jpg\" alt=\"img_9635\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/xarradalactantscolic/img_9637.jpg\" alt=\"img_9637\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/xarradalactantscolic/img_9638.jpg\" alt=\"img_9638\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/xarradalactantscolic/img_9639.jpg\" alt=\"img_9639\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/xarradalactantscolic/img_9644.jpg\" alt=\"img_9644\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/xarradalactantscolic/img_9647.jpg\" alt=\"img_9647\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /></div>"
